'''Crazed Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked once clearing the event stage [[Dark Souls (Insane)|The Crazed Cat]]. Its stage appears on the '''3rd''' or the '''26th''' of every month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases health, damage and speed. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it is obtainable from [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsules]] after beating Cosmic Club in the Interstellar Invasion chapter. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], its clear conditions is the same as the mobile version but is available on '''Mondays''' only.

